					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 747010101,
					"content": "Huh? Why does Paimon feel like there's an extra pool here all of a sudden? What does that sign say?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010102,
					"content": "\"Danger — Keep Away!\" What does that mean?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010103,
					"content": "It means exactly what it says.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010104,
					"content": "Wah! Sandrone... You made Paimon jump! Did you put this sign here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010105,
					"content": "Yes. With the intention of keeping any curious cats well away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010106,
					"content": "What's so special about this pool?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010107,
					"content": "It's full of piranhas.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010108,
					"content": "Wha—!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010109,
					"content": "Haha, just kidding. Don't tell me you actually believed that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010110,
					"content": "I learned that a few fish in the aquarium are highly territorial and can get rather aggressive. So, I moved them here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010111,
					"content": "Don't scare Paimon like that! So, this place is like a special quarantine zone for aggro fishies?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010112,
					"content": "Exactly, the water in this pool is much deeper, and there's a lot more space. It helps calm down the more territorial fish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010113,
					"content": "I also asked Sigewinne at the Fortress of Meropide for some special bait to help mellow them out a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010114,
					"content": "Oh, wow... So, you really do care about the fishies' well-being!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010115,
					"content": "I don't think anyone wants to see the aquarium turn into a blood bath.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010116,
					"content": "That's for sure! Anyway, why don't you leave this to us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010117,
					"content": "If you insist. When the fish in the pool feel comfortable enough to swim to the surface, it means they're on the mend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010118,
					"content": "So once they're all relaxed and happy, we can put them back in the aquarium?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010119,
					"content": "Where you put them is up to you. All I'm responsible for is scooping up the unruly ones and moving them here in the first place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010120,
					"content": "Understood! But that sign is way too scary. Maybe we can change it for something a little less... terrifying?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747010121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 747010121,
					"content": "Hmm... If you want. They're your fish, so I'll leave it up to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}